 "servicenow": {
  "sc_request": [
   {
    "description": "Periodic external-identity access review for the corporate directory. External and guest identities accumulate across the connected systems (the corporate directory, the source-control organization, and the messaging workspace) and must be reviewed each cycle. Review the full guest / external-identity estate, determine which external identities are no longer legitimately needed, and bring the environment to a correct and least-privilege state: remove the standing access of the external identities that should no longer have it across every system where it is held, while preserving the external identities that are still legitimately active. Leave each system consistent and close this request when the estate has been brought into a correct state.",
